1
00:01:37,850 --> 00:01:43,050
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,690
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:45,810
[Episode 23]

4
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:53,590
Right here.

5
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,950
And this one.

6
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:57,150
Nine people in total,

7
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,560
buried in 2 batches.

8
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,120
They are all down here.

9
00:02:00,870 --> 00:02:01,590
Dig.

10
00:02:01,590 --> 00:02:02,350
Let's do it.

11
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,560
We at the Divine Constable Bureau

12
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,890
have done our fair share of grave digging.

13
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,150
Why does it feel like

14
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,590
we are thieves today?

15
00:02:09,590 --> 00:02:10,520
What are you doing?

16
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,120
Stop!

17
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,800
My Lord, My Lady,

18
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,800
the villagers are coming.

19
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,580
Hurry and leave.

20
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:14,680
Let's go!

21
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:16,140
Who told you to dig?

22
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,800
What a sin!

23
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:19,730
Everyone, quiet down!

24
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:22,030
I am the village elder of Yin Village.

25
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:23,470
Who exactly are you?

26
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:24,150
How dare you

27
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:25,360
dig up others' graves here?

28
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:25,910
Exactly!

29
00:02:25,930 --> 00:02:26,910
Who told you to dig?

30
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:27,800
-Indeed!
-Indeed!

31
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,360
Quiet, everyone!

32
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,150
We are Divine Constables
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

33
00:02:29,770 --> 00:02:31,190
[Divine Constable Tally]

34
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,750
We are digging graves today

35
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:33,870
to investigate a case.

36
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:34,680
What?

37
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,000
-Investigate a case?
-Divine Constable Bureau? Haven't heard.

38
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,960
What do you mean you've never heard of it?

39
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:39,960
Besides,

40
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,120
we are not digging your family's graves.

41
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,150
The ones buried underneath

42
00:02:43,150 --> 00:02:44,800
-are the victims of the murder.
-Nonsense!

43
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,590
You can't dig anyone's grave!

44
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:47,800
No one's grave should be dug!

45
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,329
Everyone, please be quiet!

46
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:52,280
They have already been laid to rest,

47
00:02:52,310 --> 00:02:54,190
yet you want to dig them up.

48
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,360
You two,

49
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,700
please show mercy

50
00:02:56,730 --> 00:02:58,110
and stop digging.

51
00:02:58,130 --> 00:03:00,050
This is the blessed land

52
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,780
-in our village!
-Yeah!

53
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,530
Yes!

54
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:05,400
If you ruin

55
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:06,800
the feng shui of our ancestors,

56
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:07,990
our Yin Village

57
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:09,750
will suffer the loss of lives!

58
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:10,240
Yes!

59
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,190
Exactly!

60
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:12,910
Ancestors,

61
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,640
-please don't blame us!
-Everyone!

62
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:16,560
Don't kneel!

63
00:03:17,310 --> 00:03:18,150
Stop crying and making a scene!

64
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:19,079
Get up now!

65
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:20,400
Ancestors, please forgive us!

66
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,400
-Jiuying.
-Get up!

67
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,190
Get ready.

68
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,280
Li Si,

69
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,910
what are these for?

70
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:26,760
This is a peerless martial art.

71
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,930
It's very powerful.

72
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:30,850
"One mouth narrates tales of millennia;

73
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,000
a pair of hands
manipulates millions of soldiers."

74
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,460
That's what it describes.

75
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,800
All props are controlled by one person.

76
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:37,680
They can sing,

77
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,560
act,

78
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,360
fight,

79
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,190
and recite.

80
00:03:40,750 --> 00:03:42,800
If that's not a peerless martial art,
what is it?

81
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:44,590
Murders are rampant in Gutan County.

82
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:45,840
If we don't exhume the bodies
for autopsies

83
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:47,190
and catch the murderer,

84
00:03:47,190 --> 00:03:48,630
none of us will have a peaceful day!

85
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:49,120
Exactly!

86
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:49,980
What?

87
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:51,190
Exhume the bodies for autopsies?

88
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:52,560
That will bring even less peace!

89
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,560
-No!
-No!

90
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,710
Absolutely not!

91
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,120
Even if the village elder agrees,

92
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,150
we won't allow it!

93
00:03:57,150 --> 00:03:58,360
-No!
-No!

94
00:03:58,590 --> 00:04:00,000
Everyone, please calm down!

95
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,520
-Calm down, everyone!
-No! No!

96
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,800
How can this be?

97
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,750
We refuse!

98
00:04:04,770 --> 00:04:05,680
Come down.

99
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,190
Jiuying,

100
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,190
the biggest taboo

101
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,150
in shadow puppetry

102
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:14,710
-is to tie the strings together.
-Please calm down!

103
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:16,720
-These strings look tough.
-Calm down!

104
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,209
-But if they're all entangled...
-You can't dig!

105
00:04:18,209 --> 00:04:19,560
And rub against each other,

106
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,070
they will easily snap.

107
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,700
But

108
00:04:22,830 --> 00:04:24,090
watching them spin...

109
00:04:25,750 --> 00:04:26,640
But

110
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,720
watching them spin

111
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,750
is so much fun.

112
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,920
Naughty.

113
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:33,190
You absolutely can't dig!

114
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,120
Watch me.

115
00:04:34,390 --> 00:04:36,120
I have something even more fun.

116
00:04:36,430 --> 00:04:37,630
Absolutely no digging!

117
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:38,510
No digging!

118
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:54,240
Everyone, calm down

119
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,120
and listen to me!

120
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:55,920
Stop arguing!

121
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,190
Don't do anything reckless!

122
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:59,120
Father! Father!

123
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,160
Look!

124
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,510
This...

125
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,050
Shadow puppets!

126
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:11,190
The shadow puppet monsters killed someone!

127
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:13,120
The shadow puppet monsters! Run!

128
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,390
Hurry!

129
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:15,360
Run!

130
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:17,560
Run!

131
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,920
Playing tricks.

132
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,120
Perfect timing.

133
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:28,010
I'll smash you to death with this shovel!

134
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:37,560
Isn't this just

135
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,090
an ordinary shadow puppet?

136
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,680
Which unlucky fool

137
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,310
came to the graveyard

138
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:46,190
to sing opera in the middle of the night?

139
00:05:46,190 --> 00:05:48,040
Good thing we hid here.

140
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,000
Otherwise,

141
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,360
Yan Sanhuo would have

142
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,640
smashed us to death on the spot.

143
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:52,810
Yan, let's continue.

144
00:05:52,810 --> 00:05:54,000
Why scare them?

145
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,520
If we hadn't scared them,

146
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,800
how would those villagers have run away?

147
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,190
If they were there,

148
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,500
how could your Zhenzhu

149
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,750
examine the bodies?

150
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,000
I think

151
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,920
they must have been set up

152
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:07,390
by Du Zhongtao.

153
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:09,750
People came right
when they started digging.

154
00:06:09,750 --> 00:06:12,120
How could it be such a coincidence?

155
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,800
Then

156
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,120
what's the next step?

157
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,400
After the bodies are dug out,

158
00:06:19,430 --> 00:06:21,390
they'll definitely be carried back
to the government office for examination.

159
00:06:21,390 --> 00:06:22,520
When the time comes,

160
00:06:23,430 --> 00:06:25,190
you just keep an eye on it there.

161
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:26,270
You must firmly remember

162
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:27,390
every word

163
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,270
your Zhenzhu says,

164
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:30,560
and then tell me.

165
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,040
Let's go.

166
00:06:34,090 --> 00:06:37,420
[Gutan County Government]

167
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,159
These 9 victims

168
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:43,700
all have a perforating wound
on their necks.

169
00:06:44,430 --> 00:06:46,560
The clothes are soaked in blood,

170
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,120
indicating massive blood loss.

171
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,480
That is to say,

172
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,600
these 9 people

173
00:06:51,620 --> 00:06:53,710
all died of blood loss

174
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,320
after their necks were instantly pierced.

175
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,270
Jiuying?

176
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,560
Who let you in?

177
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,190
It's so scary in here.

178
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:01,950
Get out.

179
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,120
I won't get out.

180
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,050
I want to listen.

181
00:07:04,510 --> 00:07:05,310
Listen?

182
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,930
Can you understand?

183
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:09,390
These 9 people

184
00:07:09,390 --> 00:07:10,720
all have a perforating wound
on their necks.

185
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,310
The clothes are soaked with blood,

186
00:07:12,310 --> 00:07:13,750
indicating massive blood loss.

187
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:14,960
That is to say, these 9 people

188
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,520
had their necks pierced instantly

189
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,520
and bled to death.

190
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:19,590
Oh my goodness.

191
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,850
What's going on?

192
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:23,750
I think

193
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,020
maybe Jiuying

194
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,390
has an extraordinary talent

195
00:07:26,390 --> 00:07:27,800
for examining bodies.

196
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,800
Don't forget,

197
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:32,110
she's the one
who completely pieced together

198
00:07:32,110 --> 00:07:33,480
her mother's bones.

199
00:07:33,950 --> 00:07:35,510
She's simply self-taught.

200
00:07:37,190 --> 00:07:38,120
Yeah.

201
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,070
Maybe we can really train a genius

202
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,159
for our bureau in the future.

203
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,120
Jiuying, come here.

204
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:49,420
Stand here and listen carefully.

205
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,480
Go on.

206
00:07:55,159 --> 00:07:56,380
The deceased has cyanotic lips

207
00:07:56,380 --> 00:07:57,360
and a pale face.

208
00:07:57,750 --> 00:07:59,390
The clothes are soiled with excrement,

209
00:07:59,390 --> 00:08:01,600
indicating incontinence before death.

210
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,750
It indeed matches

211
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,310
the symptoms of death from blood loss.

212
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,600
Can you tell

213
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,190
what pierced them?

214
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:11,930
Good question.

215
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:15,120
The edges of the wounds are irregular,

216
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,510
and the shapes are inconsistent.

217
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:17,600
I have never seen

218
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,850
such wounds before.

219
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,800
It's hard to identify for now.

220
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:21,600
However,

221
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,790
the 9 of them

222
00:08:22,820 --> 00:08:24,160
share a common trait.

223
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:28,950
It's empty?

224
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:31,510
I have examined these 9 people

225
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:32,950
one by one.

226
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:34,960
Their hearts and livers are all missing.

227
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,090
They were deliberately hollowed out.

228
00:08:37,909 --> 00:08:39,150
Do you remember

229
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,590
that madman on Panlong Street

230
00:08:40,590 --> 00:08:41,549
yesterday?

231
00:08:42,150 --> 00:08:44,000
The shadow puppet ghost is here!

232
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:45,350
Cutting out hearts

233
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,630
and digging out livers!

234
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,690
Nine nines return to one!

235
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,390
Could it really be

236
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,890
Yin Jie's vengeful spirit

237
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:57,120
returning for revenge to resurrect

238
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,910
his wife and child?

239
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,030
Don't scare the kid.

240
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:04,360
It's only our first day in Gutan County.

241
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,300
All clues revolve

242
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:07,230
around the Yaotai Immortal Dream.

243
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,940
Especially the shadow puppet

244
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,600
that appeared in the graveyard last night.

245
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,570
Its timing and location

246
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:13,790
were too bizarre.

247
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,610
So you mean...

248
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,840
we still need to start investigating
from the shadow puppets.

249
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,260
Let's report the autopsy results

250
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:21,510
to His Highness Prince Ping first.

251
00:09:21,510 --> 00:09:22,730
Then we will start investigating

252
00:09:22,730 --> 00:09:24,130
from the shadow puppets.

253
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,120
All right.

254
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:31,750
Excuse me, you two.

255
00:09:31,750 --> 00:09:32,390
Is this—

256
00:09:32,390 --> 00:09:33,440
-I don't know. I don't know.
-Miss,

257
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,200
do you know where they sell

258
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,150
this kind of shadow puppet?

259
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:36,200
Do you recognize this?

260
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,600
The shop ahead is the one.

261
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,000
Thank you.

262
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:40,320
Gently, gently.

263
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,600
Handle with care.

264
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,150
Boss,

265
00:09:48,390 --> 00:09:49,460
why are you no longer selling

266
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:51,440
these perfectly good shadow puppets?

267
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,600
It's all because of

268
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,720
the murders these past few days.

269
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,580
Who would buy shadow puppets now?

270
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,750
This business

271
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:57,960
is impossible to run.

272
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,600
I've sold shadow puppets all my life.

273
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,600
How am I supposed to live from now on?

274
00:10:01,630 --> 00:10:02,470
Hurry up,

275
00:10:02,490 --> 00:10:03,200
load the cart.

276
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:03,440
Yes.

277
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,440
Handle everything with care.

278
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,120
Okay.

279
00:10:12,870 --> 00:10:15,720
-Boy. Alright.
-Sing over osmanthus wine.

280
00:10:15,790 --> 00:10:17,840
-Moonlight shines on glazed goblets.
-I...

281
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,910
-The wine in Gutan...
-No, listen to me.

282
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:20,150
Sweet osmanthus scent.

283
00:10:20,150 --> 00:10:22,120
Sir, which one would you like?

284
00:10:22,150 --> 00:10:23,320
Let me ask you,

285
00:10:23,510 --> 00:10:24,550
didn't this place

286
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:26,150
sell shadow puppets before?

287
00:10:26,150 --> 00:10:27,700
Why is it selling wine now?

288
00:10:27,750 --> 00:10:29,390
You have a good eye, Sir.

289
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:31,200
-Look at this glazed goblet.
-I...

290
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,360
Crystal clear,

291
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,390
with superb craftsmanship.

292
00:10:33,390 --> 00:10:34,520
How many do you want?

293
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:35,870
How many?

294
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,390
I want this.

295
00:10:38,150 --> 00:10:39,750
Did you use to sell shadow puppets?

296
00:10:39,750 --> 00:10:40,960
Have you changed to selling wine?

297
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,880
Sir,

298
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,790
if you're not buying wine,

299
00:10:42,790 --> 00:10:44,080
please take this thing

300
00:10:44,110 --> 00:10:44,910
and leave quickly.

301
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:46,390
Don't affect our business.

302
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:46,970
How about this?

303
00:10:46,970 --> 00:10:47,940
Just tell me

304
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,270
where the shadow puppet shop

305
00:10:49,270 --> 00:10:50,390
moved to,

306
00:10:50,390 --> 00:10:51,990
and I'll leave immediately.

307
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,150
Leave, leave, leave.

308
00:10:54,150 --> 00:10:54,960
Leave, leave, leave.

309
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,600
Why are you pushing me?

310
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,240
Leave quickly.

311
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,600
-Don't disturb my business!
-You don't know me?

312
00:10:56,870 --> 00:10:59,560
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

313
00:10:58,790 --> 00:10:59,600
Bosss,

314
00:10:59,790 --> 00:11:00,720
look carefully.

315
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,250
Do you recognize it?

316
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:03,960
That's right.

317
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,060
It is my shadow puppet.

318
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:06,120
There's none uglier than it.

319
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:06,960
Yours?

320
00:11:07,150 --> 00:11:07,960
Of course.

321
00:11:08,030 --> 00:11:09,320
Great.

322
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,150
When was it sold?

323
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:13,200
Yesterday at dusk.

324
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,910
I was about to close the shop

325
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:15,790
when a girl came

326
00:11:15,790 --> 00:11:17,720
and picked the ugliest one.

327
00:11:17,720 --> 00:11:18,790
If you didn't look closely,

328
00:11:18,790 --> 00:11:20,190
you'd think she was a boy.

329
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:21,550
Xia Jiuying?

330
00:11:23,390 --> 00:11:25,510
Did she say why she bought
the shadow puppet?

331
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:26,660
She said...

332
00:11:27,510 --> 00:11:28,960
She said her brother asked her to buy it.

333
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,960
Her brother?

334
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:35,720
How did she pay?

335
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,550
She used banknotes.

336
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:39,520
She was quite generous.

337
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:41,480
She didn't even want the change.

338
00:11:41,630 --> 00:11:42,550
Let me see.

339
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,000
This...

340
00:11:48,070 --> 00:11:49,020
[Divine Constable Tally]

341
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,390
My Lord.

342
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,240
Well...

343
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:57,720
Three notes, not one less.

344
00:11:58,510 --> 00:11:59,320
Look.

345
00:11:59,420 --> 00:12:01,250
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

346
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,960
I am Constable Iron of
Divine Constable Bureau in Tianhuang City.

347
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:03,590
[Divine Constable Tally]

348
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:04,790
Now,

349
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,720
I need to borrow your banknotes.

350
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,510
Okay.

351
00:12:08,470 --> 00:12:12,220
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

352
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:09,720
My Lord!

353
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,390
My Lord!

354
00:12:12,790 --> 00:12:15,050
When will you return the banknotes to me?

355
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:15,910
My Lord!

356
00:12:17,150 --> 00:12:18,390
Empty joy.

357
00:12:27,470 --> 00:12:29,270
[Divine Constable Tally]

358
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,250
Time

359
00:12:45,750 --> 00:12:48,420
is not a good medicine to heal scars.

360
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,510
Get up!

361
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:09,790
Bury your parents first,

362
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,870
then go to Gutan County.

363
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:14,490
There is someone you want to see there.

364
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:33,570
[100 taels]

365
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:36,150
Baoyuan Bank.

366
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,840
Isn't this the largest bank

367
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,030
in Tianhuang City?

368
00:13:39,030 --> 00:13:40,910
It's no surprise
these notes ended up here.

369
00:13:40,910 --> 00:13:42,150
Is there anything strange about it?

370
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:42,960
Hand it over.

371
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,150
This is...

372
00:13:52,730 --> 00:13:53,630
[100 taels]

373
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:03,570
The Star-Gathering Pavilion?

374
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:05,360
So,

375
00:14:05,910 --> 00:14:07,150
the one who bought the shadow puppets

376
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:08,390
and messed around
in the graveyard last night

377
00:14:08,390 --> 00:14:09,200
was Li Si.

378
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,510
Li Si is still alive.

379
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,020
What did I tell you?

380
00:14:14,150 --> 00:14:16,150
That kid wouldn't go down so easily.

381
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,320
Well, well.

382
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:23,120
So you two have been in cahoots all along,

383
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:23,840
keeping us in the dark,

384
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:24,570
haven't you?

385
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:25,750
Jiuying,

386
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:27,150
have you seen Li Si?

387
00:14:27,390 --> 00:14:28,910
We are on a secret mission.

388
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:30,200
I can't tell you.

389
00:14:32,550 --> 00:14:33,320
So,

390
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:35,070
Li Si also came to Gutan County.

391
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,150
Last night, he

392
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,250
used the shadow puppets

393
00:14:37,250 --> 00:14:38,510
to disperse the villagers for us.

394
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:39,030
This means

395
00:14:39,030 --> 00:14:39,740
he has been keeping an eye on

396
00:14:39,740 --> 00:14:40,870
this case all along.

397
00:14:43,030 --> 00:14:44,150
We are in the open,

398
00:14:44,910 --> 00:14:46,040
and he is in the dark.

399
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:47,240
Not to mention

400
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,600
he has Xia Jiuying as his informant.

401
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,120
He probably knows

402
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,790
much more than we do.

403
00:14:53,550 --> 00:14:55,350
Where do you think he will start?

404
00:14:56,510 --> 00:14:59,960
The most crucial place

405
00:15:00,910 --> 00:15:02,790
concerning the safety
of the Grand Heir Apparent.

406
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:04,000
Golden Dragon Pavilion.

407
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,600
With Li Qingyang's skills,

408
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:07,910
even if we can't get in,

409
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:09,720
it doesn't mean he can't.

410
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,920
He might have already

411
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:12,150
beaten us to it.

412
00:15:13,150 --> 00:15:14,360
We can't fall behind either.

413
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:14,840
Alright.

414
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:15,550
I'll go

415
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:17,240
return the banknotes to the boss first.

416
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,270
The boss

417
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,600
was really about to cry.

418
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,240
Let's go.

419
00:15:21,410 --> 00:15:22,200
Let's go.

420
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:28,440
Li Si,

421
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:30,920
you really are still alive.

422
00:15:32,140 --> 00:15:35,070
[Department of Food Affairs]

423
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:33,790
His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent

424
00:15:33,790 --> 00:15:35,270
is arriving tomorrow.

425
00:15:35,510 --> 00:15:36,870
All his meals

426
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:39,150
are the responsibility
of our Department of Food Affairs.

427
00:15:39,150 --> 00:15:41,070
If anything goes wrong

428
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:43,210
with the food going into his mouth...

429
00:15:46,390 --> 00:15:47,450
To put it lightly,

430
00:15:47,470 --> 00:15:48,960
it's a dereliction of duty.

431
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,020
To put it severely,

432
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:52,360
it's murdering the Grand Heir Apparent,

433
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,960
which means execution
for your entire family.

434
00:15:54,980 --> 00:15:56,380
The General has arrived!

435
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:02,140
I'm Liu Xianneng, Director
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

436
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:03,790
paying my respects to you, General Sui.

437
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:04,600
General Sui,

438
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,930
why have you come
to the kitchen in person?

439
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,440
You are the director?

440
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:09,510
Perfect.

441
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:11,510
You are exactly who I'm looking for.

442
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,870
What do you mean by that, General?

443
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:14,790
Let me ask you.

444
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:16,660
It's one thing
that your Golden Dragon Pavilion

445
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:18,240
doesn't allow meat,

446
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,000
but why is even wine forbidden?

447
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,550
Please don't take offense, General.

448
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:23,110
Since ancient times,
one must clear the mind

449
00:16:23,110 --> 00:16:24,060
and limit desires
in a place of cultivation

450
00:16:24,060 --> 00:16:25,390
to achieve immortality.

451
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:27,320
Wine and meat are poison to the body,

452
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,980
so we dare not partake of them.

453
00:16:31,150 --> 00:16:32,870
Those are rules only you cultivators

454
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:33,630
follow.

455
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:35,510
I have no desire to become an immortal.

456
00:16:35,510 --> 00:16:36,420
Why should I suffer

457
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:37,750
this nonsense with you?

458
00:16:37,790 --> 00:16:38,600
Ji Xun!

459
00:16:38,870 --> 00:16:39,600
I am here.

460
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,600
Search the place!

461
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,910
I don't believe
there isn't a single jar of wine

462
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:43,750
in this kitchen!

463
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:44,440
Director Liu.

464
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,120
Men,

465
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:45,790
search everywhere!

466
00:16:45,790 --> 00:16:46,480
-Yes!
-Yes!

467
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,130
Calm down, General.

468
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:50,960
Eating vegetarian
and abstaining from alcohol

469
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,200
are Golden Dragon Pavilion's rules.

470
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,240
Everyone staying in the pavilion

471
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,490
must obey them.

472
00:16:54,550 --> 00:16:56,510
We lowly ones have no choice.

473
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:57,890
How about this?

474
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:58,990
There are a few good taverns

475
00:16:58,990 --> 00:17:00,200
in the county town.

476
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,550
If you don't mind,

477
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:02,790
I am

478
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:04,490
willing to show you the way.

479
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:07,790
So you mean,

480
00:17:08,310 --> 00:17:10,200
with the Grand Heir Apparent
arriving soon,

481
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:10,869
I,

482
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:12,339
the commander
responsible for his protection,

483
00:17:12,339 --> 00:17:13,960
should go out drinking and making merry?

484
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,160
If word gets out,

485
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:16,589
wouldn't I become

486
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:18,369
a useless drunkard who disregards

487
00:17:18,369 --> 00:17:19,750
the Grand Heir Apparent's safety?

488
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:21,140
How could you come up with

489
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:22,400
such a vicious scheme?

490
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:24,690
I-I didn't mean that.

491
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:26,790
I think you harbor evil intentions

492
00:17:26,790 --> 00:17:27,760
and have ulterior motives!

493
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:28,870
Xiaoshan!

494
00:17:32,790 --> 00:17:33,900
Stop!

495
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,160
Who is making a racket

496
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,970
in this peaceful place?

497
00:17:42,550 --> 00:17:43,610
Master Changping.

498
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:47,190
[Changpingzi,
Principal of the Golden Dragon Pavilion]

499
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,880
I'm just on a routine patrol.

500
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:52,720
Why did it alarm you, Master?

501
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:54,790
So it's you, General.

502
00:17:55,750 --> 00:17:56,550
Who is he?

503
00:17:57,750 --> 00:18:00,720
Changpingzi,
Principal of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

504
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,110
When the abbot is in seclusion,

505
00:18:02,110 --> 00:18:03,590
he's in charge of everything

506
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:04,790
here.

507
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:07,270
Did our disciples misbehave

508
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:08,640
and anger you, General?

509
00:18:09,750 --> 00:18:11,440
Just a little misunderstanding.

510
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,770
Nothing to worry about.

511
00:18:13,030 --> 00:18:14,760
But since you're here, Master,

512
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:17,550
I do have a presumptuous request.

513
00:18:18,590 --> 00:18:20,160
I hope you can grant it.

514
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:36,400
You want to see
the Dragon Saliva Crystal, General?

515
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,390
The Grand Heir Apparent is coming

516
00:18:38,390 --> 00:18:39,960
to ask for the crystal soon.

517
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:43,160
The Xuanjie Battalion
has been appointed by the Emperor

518
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,550
to protect him.

519
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,740
To be safe,

520
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:47,810
we have to take a look

521
00:18:47,810 --> 00:18:49,480
at the treasure in advance.

522
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:52,000
It's not for my own sake,

523
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,650
but for the Great Shi Empire,

524
00:18:53,790 --> 00:18:55,270
I have to be careful.

525
00:18:58,550 --> 00:18:59,960
What do you mean, Master?

526
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:02,190
Do you think

527
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:03,310
I am not qualified?

528
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:05,060
You misunderstood, General.

529
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,200
It's not that

530
00:19:06,220 --> 00:19:08,200
I don't want to show it to you,

531
00:19:08,310 --> 00:19:09,110
but

532
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:10,850
there is no such thing as

533
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,540
Dragon Saliva Crystal at all.

534
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:14,720
What did you say?

535
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:18,660
There is no Dragon Saliva Crystal?

536
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:20,830
Since the establishment
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

537
00:19:20,830 --> 00:19:22,720
there has never been such a thing.

538
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:25,290
The golden dragon breathing
the spirit of heaven and earth,

539
00:19:25,290 --> 00:19:26,640
and its saliva turning into crystal

540
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:27,570
are just visions

541
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:29,790
woven by

542
00:19:29,790 --> 00:19:31,480
devout men and women.

543
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,180
People spread the rumors,

544
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,790
and everyone believed them to be true.

545
00:19:34,790 --> 00:19:37,510
If you don't want to show it to me,

546
00:19:37,750 --> 00:19:38,680
you don't have to

547
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:40,750
make up such lies to deceive me.

548
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:44,200
The Dragon Saliva Crystal
must be in the pavilion.

549
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:45,680
Otherwise,

550
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:47,420
wouldn't it be ridiculous

551
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,750
for His Highness
the Grand Heir Apparent

552
00:19:48,750 --> 00:19:50,920
to come in person for the medicine?

553
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:54,350
All living beings
can't attain the true Way

554
00:19:54,510 --> 00:19:56,510
because of their delusional minds.

555
00:19:56,510 --> 00:19:57,310
General,

556
00:19:57,550 --> 00:19:58,720
I actually

557
00:19:58,790 --> 00:20:00,680
have a presumptuous request.

558
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:03,720
Please speak.

559
00:20:04,350 --> 00:20:05,480
Please

560
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,550
move out of Langyue Studio.

561
00:20:07,790 --> 00:20:10,000
I am a pillar of the imperial court,

562
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:11,240
with countless military merits.

563
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:13,400
Can't I even stay in a side pavilion?

564
00:20:15,310 --> 00:20:17,000
General, you may not know this.

565
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:19,550
Last night, I observed the stars.

566
00:20:20,110 --> 00:20:21,960
The Moon occulting the Net Mansion

567
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:23,510
is a terrible omen.

568
00:20:23,540 --> 00:20:26,240
The Yin energy in the Langyue Studio
is already strong.

569
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:27,400
On ordinary days,

570
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,750
it would be fine to stay there.

571
00:20:28,750 --> 00:20:31,550
But tomorrow happens to be the fifteenth.

572
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,350
Solar eclipses occur on the new moon,

573
00:20:33,350 --> 00:20:35,160
and lunar eclipses on the full moon.

574
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,910
If we encounter a lunar eclipse,

575
00:20:36,910 --> 00:20:38,370
Yin and Yang will reverse,

576
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:39,930
and cold evil will prevail.

577
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:41,170
I'm afraid

578
00:20:41,510 --> 00:20:43,510
there might be some unclean things.

579
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,160
I am forged in iron and blood.

580
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:48,350
The last thing I lack is Yang energy.

581
00:20:48,350 --> 00:20:50,920
Even 100 ghosts can't get close to me.

582
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,140
If there really are any

583
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:54,160
unclean things,

584
00:20:54,510 --> 00:20:57,040
I will just cut them down
for you with my blade.

585
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:04,310
Since you insist,

586
00:21:04,550 --> 00:21:06,400
I'll let your wish be granted.

587
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:15,270
Just cheap tricks.

588
00:21:24,830 --> 00:21:26,960
A hundred ghosts can hardly get close.

589
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,000
Then do you know

590
00:21:28,790 --> 00:21:30,120
that the greatest ghost

591
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:31,720
is your inner demon?

592
00:21:36,910 --> 00:21:39,370
[Langyue Studio]

593
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:44,920
General.

594
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:02,590
All right, all right.

595
00:22:02,590 --> 00:22:03,350
Come here,

596
00:22:04,030 --> 00:22:04,830
all of you.

597
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,590
Let me ask you,

598
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:10,370
has anyone among you

599
00:22:10,390 --> 00:22:12,630
seen the Dragon Saliva Crystal?

600
00:22:16,030 --> 00:22:17,430
Changpingzi said

601
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:18,830
the Dragon Saliva Crystal

602
00:22:18,830 --> 00:22:20,550
is merely a legend.

603
00:22:20,920 --> 00:22:21,980
Is that true or not?

604
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:26,550
You, tell me.

605
00:22:27,830 --> 00:22:29,200
Reporting to you, General,

606
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:31,480
I-I do not know.

607
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:33,680
My Lord,

608
00:22:34,310 --> 00:22:35,200
I know.

609
00:22:37,310 --> 00:22:39,110
I heard that the Dragon Saliva Crystal

610
00:22:39,110 --> 00:22:40,790
is hidden in the Golden Dragon Hall.

611
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:41,640
Li Xiaosi,

612
00:22:41,830 --> 00:22:43,030
do not speak nonsense!

613
00:22:43,030 --> 00:22:44,560
I am not speaking nonsense.

614
00:22:44,790 --> 00:22:46,270
Is this not what you said?

615
00:22:46,510 --> 00:22:47,240
My Lord,

616
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:48,440
h-he is new here

617
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,590
and just repeating hearsay.

618
00:22:49,590 --> 00:22:51,250
Do not listen to his nonsense.

619
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:54,800
I have spoken out of turn.

620
00:22:56,350 --> 00:22:57,200
Enough.

621
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:58,200
You may all leave.

622
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,960
I am going to rest.

623
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:01,240
-Yes.
-Yes.

624
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:05,720
Hurry, hurry.

625
00:23:17,220 --> 00:23:21,260
[Langyue Studio]

626
00:23:24,310 --> 00:23:25,200
Xiaoshan,

627
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:27,830
why did you not dare to admit
in front of General Sui Bing

628
00:23:27,830 --> 00:23:29,350
that the Dragon Saliva Crystal

629
00:23:29,350 --> 00:23:31,270
is in the Golden Dragon Pavilion?

630
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,450
Could it be that

631
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,310
you lied to me?

632
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:38,480
Li Xiaosi,

633
00:23:38,920 --> 00:23:40,240
are you a fool?

634
00:23:41,030 --> 00:23:42,240
If Sui Bing knew

635
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:43,440
about the Dragon Saliva Crystal,

636
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:45,240
would you still be able to get it?

637
00:23:47,510 --> 00:23:48,640
So you were

638
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:50,690
helping me guard the treasure.

639
00:23:51,350 --> 00:23:52,160
Of course.

640
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:54,310
Let's go.

641
00:23:54,290 --> 00:23:56,240
[Langyue Studio]

642
00:24:08,590 --> 00:24:12,370
Sui Bing, Sui Bing.

643
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:17,670
Sui Bing.

644
00:24:21,590 --> 00:24:22,640
I am Sui Bing,

645
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:25,310
Commander of the Xuanjie Battalion.

646
00:24:25,310 --> 00:24:27,510
I did not know you had arrived,
Golden Dragon God.

647
00:24:27,510 --> 00:24:28,570
Please forgive me.

648
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:29,960
Spare my life.

649
00:24:30,350 --> 00:24:32,150
You have spent half your life
in the military

650
00:24:32,150 --> 00:24:33,930
with great achievements.

651
00:24:34,310 --> 00:24:36,550
You are only in this miserable state

652
00:24:36,640 --> 00:24:38,440
because you were marginalized.

653
00:24:38,830 --> 00:24:40,560
What crime have you committed?

654
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:44,530
I now bestow upon you
a Dragon Saliva Crystal.

655
00:24:44,720 --> 00:24:47,160
Go and exchange it for a better future.

656
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:53,570
This is the Dragon Saliva Crystal.

657
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,350
Thank you, Golden Dragon God!

658
00:24:56,350 --> 00:24:58,010
Thank you, Golden Dragon God!

659
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:01,060
Golden Dragon God!

660
00:25:04,310 --> 00:25:06,590
It was the Golden Dragon God
coming to me in a dream just now.

661
00:25:06,590 --> 00:25:07,680
It gave me a hint.

662
00:25:08,790 --> 00:25:10,200
The Dragon Saliva Crystal

663
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,860
spat from the dragon's mouth.

664
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:14,490
It is indeed hidden
in the Golden Dragon Hall.

665
00:25:15,180 --> 00:25:17,730
[Golden Dragon Hall]

666
00:25:25,400 --> 00:25:27,640
Will Sui come?

667
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:29,870
I have already lit
the Soul-Guiding Incense

668
00:25:29,870 --> 00:25:31,040
in his room.

669
00:25:32,110 --> 00:25:33,200
He will dream of

670
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:34,530
whatever is on his mind.

671
00:25:34,830 --> 00:25:35,680
Therefore,

672
00:25:36,590 --> 00:25:37,990
he will definitely come.

673
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:39,570
I don't understand.

674
00:25:44,310 --> 00:25:45,110
He is here.

675
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:49,960
Should I go get

676
00:25:49,980 --> 00:25:51,640
Zhenzhu and the others to help?

677
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:52,440
No need.

678
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:54,720
You go back first

679
00:25:54,760 --> 00:25:56,040
and give this to them.

680
00:25:56,350 --> 00:25:57,280
Leave this to me.

681
00:26:01,470 --> 00:26:08,750
[Golden Dragon Hall]

682
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:14,960
You should have been wielding
your sword to protect the country.

683
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:16,400
Why act

684
00:26:16,510 --> 00:26:19,510
as a burglar tonight?

685
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:22,440
Who are you?

686
00:26:26,350 --> 00:26:29,110
I'm Yun Hai,
Abbot of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

687
00:26:28,410 --> 00:26:31,960
[Yun Hai,
Abbot of the Golden Dragon Pavilion]

688
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:32,400
paying respects to you, General Huaihua.

689
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:35,760
So you are the abbot
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

690
00:26:35,790 --> 00:26:36,920
Haven't you been in seclusion

691
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:37,790
for many years?

692
00:26:38,350 --> 00:26:39,720
What do you mean

693
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,480
by "burglar"?

694
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:41,400
You don't take me

695
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:43,070
for a petty thief, do you?

696
00:26:43,550 --> 00:26:45,140
What you seek

697
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:47,310
is not in this hall.

698
00:26:48,270 --> 00:26:49,070
Yun Hai,

699
00:26:49,370 --> 00:26:52,090
[Golden Dragon Hall]

700
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:51,510
since you already know why I visit

701
00:26:51,510 --> 00:26:52,750
the Golden Dragon Hall tonight,

702
00:26:52,750 --> 00:26:54,310
why don't you

703
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:57,350
hand over the precious crystal
immediately?

704
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:58,680
Tomorrow,

705
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:01,510
the Grand Heir Apparent will arrive.

706
00:27:01,960 --> 00:27:03,750
As the commander
responsible for his safety,

707
00:27:03,750 --> 00:27:05,350
I am patrolling here tonight.

708
00:27:05,350 --> 00:27:07,150
Securing the crystal in advance

709
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:08,720
to ease His Highness's worries

710
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:10,590
is exactly what a loyal subject should do.

711
00:27:10,590 --> 00:27:13,070
You, as the abbot,

712
00:27:13,550 --> 00:27:14,590
refuse to cooperate

713
00:27:14,590 --> 00:27:15,960
and keep making excuses.

714
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:16,750
Could it be

715
00:27:17,310 --> 00:27:19,310
that you want to keep this treasure

716
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:20,790
for yourself?

717
00:27:21,070 --> 00:27:23,830
It is not that I want
to keep it for myself,

718
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:25,400
but that the Dragon Saliva Crystal

719
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:28,400
simply does not exist in this world.

720
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:30,880
Moonlight in water,
blossoms in the mirror,

721
00:27:30,880 --> 00:27:32,510
dreams, phantoms, bubbles and shadows—

722
00:27:32,510 --> 00:27:33,920
all are but illusions.

723
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:34,900
General,

724
00:27:35,590 --> 00:27:37,880
why must you be so obsessed?

725
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:40,310
So stubborn.

726
00:27:40,550 --> 00:27:42,690
I think you've been
in seclusion for too long

727
00:27:42,690 --> 00:27:44,170
[Golden Dragon Hall]

728
00:27:42,790 --> 00:27:44,590
and have become senile.

729
00:27:45,130 --> 00:27:45,850
[Golden Dragon Hall]

730
00:28:00,070 --> 00:28:01,200
Pardon me.

731
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:11,640
There is more than one burglar

732
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,920
tonight.

733
00:28:13,960 --> 00:28:14,880
Come out.

734
00:28:29,500 --> 00:28:30,950
[Golden Dragon Hall]

735
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:34,040
I am Li Xiaosi,

736
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:36,860
Deputy Director
of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

737
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:39,590
paying my respects to you, Abbot Yun Hai.

738
00:28:39,590 --> 00:28:41,250
The mantis stalks the cicada,

739
00:28:41,790 --> 00:28:44,510
unaware of the oriole behind.

740
00:28:47,550 --> 00:28:49,400
What a clever man.

741
00:28:49,590 --> 00:28:51,720
To steal the treasure
through someone else's hands.

742
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:53,200
You shouldn't have planted greed

743
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:54,920
in Sui Bing's heart,

744
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:57,400
bringing about evil consequences.

745
00:28:57,550 --> 00:28:59,240
Master, you are mistaken.

746
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:00,680
I did not

747
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,480
plant this seed.

748
00:29:02,310 --> 00:29:08,560
[Golden Dragon Hall]

749
00:29:02,550 --> 00:29:04,480
He was already corrupt.

750
00:29:05,110 --> 00:29:06,110
I merely

751
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:08,680
used a little trick

752
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:10,640
to make it sprout.

753
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:11,720
Besides,

754
00:29:12,070 --> 00:29:13,720
to tell you the truth,

755
00:29:14,070 --> 00:29:16,830
whether such a thing as
the Dragon Saliva Crystal

756
00:29:16,830 --> 00:29:17,720
exists or not,

757
00:29:18,270 --> 00:29:20,240
I really don't care.

758
00:29:21,070 --> 00:29:22,880
Who exactly are you?

759
00:29:23,110 --> 00:29:24,400
What is your intention

760
00:29:24,550 --> 00:29:26,510
in disguising yourself as a director

761
00:29:26,510 --> 00:29:28,880
and sneaking into our pavilion?

762
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:30,960
Master, you've been
in seclusion for so long,

763
00:29:30,960 --> 00:29:32,310
and you probably don't know.

764
00:29:32,300 --> 00:29:39,090
[Golden Dragon Hall]

765
00:29:32,430 --> 00:29:33,240
Nowadays,

766
00:29:34,110 --> 00:29:35,590
the case of the shadow puppet ghost

767
00:29:35,590 --> 00:29:37,680
killing people in this county

768
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:39,440
is causing an uproar.

769
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:41,180
This case is full of doubts

770
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:42,730
and has not yet been solved.

771
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:44,510
I am worried

772
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:46,930
that if this vengeful ghost

773
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:49,470
comes to haunt the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

774
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:52,070
wouldn't His Highness
the Grand Heir Apparent

775
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:53,310
be in danger?

776
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:57,200
Sui Bing is a good-for-nothing.

777
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:58,240
He can't be

778
00:29:58,550 --> 00:29:59,960
relied upon.

779
00:30:00,790 --> 00:30:02,050
So when the time comes,

780
00:30:04,110 --> 00:30:06,240
I'm afraid only your pavilion

781
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:09,130
can ensure the safety
of the Grand Heir Apparent.

782
00:30:10,720 --> 00:30:11,920
So you are here

783
00:30:12,550 --> 00:30:14,680
to test me.

784
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:15,960
I humbly

785
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:19,450
ask for your guidance, Master.

786
00:30:28,350 --> 00:30:31,110
All the evil karma created in the past

787
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:35,480
comes from beginningless greed,
anger, and ignorance.

788
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:46,080
[East Gate]

789
00:30:59,460 --> 00:31:02,260
[Huo Daozhang, Minister of Rites]

790
00:31:10,390 --> 00:31:12,390
[East Gate]

791
00:31:40,190 --> 00:31:40,990
Jiuying!

792
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:42,200
Get ready.

793
00:31:42,200 --> 00:31:43,460
They're almost there.

794
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,200
I have to say,

795
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:47,350
such a terrible idea

796
00:31:47,750 --> 00:31:49,610
could only come from Li Qingyang.

797
00:31:50,110 --> 00:31:51,040
You go back first

798
00:31:51,070 --> 00:31:52,310
and give this to them.

799
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:54,720
[Mask as the ghost to snare the ghost;
Reunite within the Golden Dragon Pavilion]

800
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,440
Go!

801
00:32:03,470 --> 00:32:04,270
Yes!

802
00:32:09,800 --> 00:32:11,300
[Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop]

803
00:32:11,830 --> 00:32:12,550
What's going on?

804
00:32:12,550 --> 00:32:13,510
Where did these shadow puppets come from?

805
00:32:13,510 --> 00:32:14,830
How should I know?

806
00:32:17,350 --> 00:32:18,750
What exactly happened?

807
00:32:18,750 --> 00:32:19,720
My Lord,

808
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,250
someone is playing tricks.

809
00:32:21,510 --> 00:32:23,440
The shadow puppet ghost is coming!

810
00:32:24,110 --> 00:32:24,830
You filthy scoundrels

811
00:32:24,830 --> 00:32:27,110
in human skin!

812
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:28,160
None of you will escape!

813
00:32:28,160 --> 00:32:29,000
Behave!

814
00:32:29,310 --> 00:32:30,270
It will dig out all

815
00:32:30,270 --> 00:32:31,110
your hearts and livers!

816
00:32:31,110 --> 00:32:32,570
Dig them out! Dig them out!

817
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:34,200
How dare you, insolent peasant,

818
00:32:34,200 --> 00:32:35,400
speak such wild words

819
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:36,920
and insult the Grand Heir Apparent!

820
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:38,030
You deserve to die!

821
00:32:38,110 --> 00:32:38,920
Men,

822
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:41,440
execute him on the spot!

823
00:32:45,110 --> 00:32:46,590
Who dares to rebel?

824
00:32:47,510 --> 00:32:49,270
I'm Constable Frost, Bai Zhenzhu,
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

825
00:32:49,270 --> 00:32:50,400
I'm Constable Iron, Yan Cheng.

826
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:51,960
-Paying respects to Your Highness
-Paying respects to Your Highness

827
00:32:51,960 --> 00:32:53,440
-and My Lord.
-and My Lord.

828
00:32:54,180 --> 00:32:55,780
Divine Constable Bureau?

829
00:32:57,510 --> 00:32:58,400
Tell me,

830
00:32:58,920 --> 00:33:00,270
what exactly happened?

831
00:33:01,110 --> 00:33:02,510
My Lord,

832
00:33:02,550 --> 00:33:03,830
this man can't be killed.

833
00:33:03,830 --> 00:33:04,740
Nine murders have recently occurred

834
00:33:04,740 --> 00:33:06,020
in Gutan County.

835
00:33:06,270 --> 00:33:07,550
Legend has it
that a vengeful shadow puppet ghost

836
00:33:07,550 --> 00:33:08,680
is seeking revenge.

837
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:09,880
The disturbance just now

838
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:11,790
might have been deliberately
caused by the murderer.

839
00:33:11,790 --> 00:33:12,550
Shadow puppet ghost?

840
00:33:12,550 --> 00:33:13,920
Although this man is mad,

841
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:15,350
he might know the inside story.

842
00:33:15,350 --> 00:33:18,010
We should arrest him
and interrogate him first.

843
00:33:18,350 --> 00:33:20,210
A vengeful ghost killing people?

844
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,830
Shadow puppet ghost.

845
00:33:22,860 --> 00:33:24,660
The shadow puppet ghost is here.

846
00:33:24,750 --> 00:33:26,550
The shadow puppet ghost is here.

847
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:30,790
The blessing ceremony is approaching.

848
00:33:30,790 --> 00:33:32,880
How can such an absurd thing happen?

849
00:33:33,110 --> 00:33:34,790
Desperate times
call for desperate measures.

850
00:33:34,790 --> 00:33:36,510
Your Highness, My Lord,

851
00:33:36,510 --> 00:33:37,440
I beg you

852
00:33:37,480 --> 00:33:39,030
to allow us to accompany you

853
00:33:39,070 --> 00:33:40,400
to fulfill our duty of protection,

854
00:33:40,400 --> 00:33:41,350
and at the same time,

855
00:33:41,350 --> 00:33:43,350
thoroughly investigate this case.

856
00:33:55,400 --> 00:33:56,410
Relaying

857
00:33:56,610 --> 00:33:59,870
the verbal decree of His Highness
the Grand Heir Apparent:

858
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:00,920
Granted.

859
00:34:02,510 --> 00:34:03,400
You are ordered

860
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:05,350
to close the case

861
00:34:05,510 --> 00:34:06,910
within 3 days from today.

862
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:07,890
Otherwise,

